                "title": "Baguette Knob with Arc Rose",
                "description": "The Baguette Knob with Arc Rose is available either of two colors for the knobs: clear crystal, or amber. The Arc Rosette is also available in an array of finish options, for a stunning end look that is customizable. The Arc Short Plate with Baguette Knob is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. It will fit most standard predrilled interior doors.",
